{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13220800","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13220800","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1322080001:1":{"text":"这花环……这花环是你们从哪里拿到的？","source_cn":"这花环……这花环是你们从哪里拿到的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E4B8B6A7CADFB8E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:1::2":{"text":"花环","source_cn":"花环","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4914AF0F181E0860","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322080002:0":{"text":"你……你们是亡灵……？艾雅在上……艾琳娜，快过来站在我身后……别离她太近。","source_cn":"你……你们是亡灵……？艾雅在上……艾琳娜，快过来站在我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD710C0B6D3C3111","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1322080002":{"text":"你……你们是亡灵……？艾雅在上……艾琳娜，快过来站在我身后……别离她太近。","source_cn":"你……你们是亡灵……？艾雅在上……艾琳娜，快过来站在我身后……别离她太近。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD710C0B6D3C3111","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322080003:0":{"text":"修士宣传过这件事，我丈夫也这么说，可我还从没和亡灵打过交道……我的艾琳娜年纪还小，你们可不能吓着她了。","source_cn":"修士宣传过这件事，我丈夫也这么说，可我还从没和亡灵打过...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEBD2FF0FE8D9D728","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322080004:0":{"text":"不，我不会做任何事，我明白……对母亲来说，孩子就是一切。","source_cn":"不，我不会做任何事，我明白……对母亲来说，孩子就是一切。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC59B7351A9118BCD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1322080005:0":{"text":"我的儿子戴蒙……他不知道跑哪儿去了……我只想找到他！","source_cn":"我的儿子戴蒙……他不知道跑哪儿去了……我只想找到他！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA73879DE51384C61","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1322080006:1":{"text":"哎呀，你儿子走丢了？怪不得看着脸色不好。你问这花环，是它能帮你找到孩子吗？要是能的话，这花环就给你……","source_cn":"哎呀，你儿子走丢了？怪不得看着脸色不好。你问这花环，是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBAF6E63D1AAC1BD4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:7::2":{"text":"花环","source_cn":"花环","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4914AF0F181E0860","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1322080007:0":{"text":"我……我只想知道这花环是谁编织的？","source_cn":"我……我只想知道这花环是谁编织的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB665C112944367EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1322080008:1":{"text":"——是一个小哥哥给我做的！妈妈都不会编这么漂亮的花环呢。那个哥哥好厉害，一下就把花环编好了！","sou